althy subjects determined by nonlinear mixed-effects modeling. <i>Therapeutic drug monitoring 32(2):189–193</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1097/FTD.0b013e3181cf27d3\">10.1097/FTD.0b013e3181cf27d3</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20216121\">20216121</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Tao_2010: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
